data: {"id": "94a0683416e64280-thinking-parallel_evidence-1609", "run_id": "94a0683416e64280", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n### Kubernetes 事实\n| 维度 | 事实 |\n|------|------|\n| Pod 状态 | Running（但 Ready=False，ContainersNotReady） |\n| 容器 `app` 状态 | Waiting，Reason=CrashLoopBackOff |\n| Last State | Terminated，Reason=**OOMKilled**，Exit Code=137 |\n| Restart Count | **21 次** |\n| 内存 Limits | **64Mi** (cpu: 100m) |\n| 内存 Requests | 8Mi (cpu: 5m) |\n| QoS Class | Burstable |\n| Command | `python3 -u -c import time; print('startup allocation 256Mi', flush=True); memory=bytearray(256*1024*1024); time.sleep(86400)` |\n| Events | ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789383123953, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

