data: {"id": "94a0683416e64280-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "94a0683416e64280", "seq": 1610, "ts_ms": 1789383130895, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 39.142, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-v15", "name": "workload"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/94a0683416e64280-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "131fd0d08345685d7b57cf20fd514afe09010b552180327ab9bc2ae490d929c3", "bytes": 2420}, "snapshot_sha256": "af39c003b00fe073d82171d200288c61dd9dd2f0b2fb27aa3e5528579805ea5f"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "94a0683416e64280-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "94a0683416e64280", "seq": 1611, "ts_ms": 1789383130896, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "94a0683416e64280-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "94a0683416e64280", "seq": 1612, "ts_ms": 1789383141050, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 10.154, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1787, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v15/workload` | CrashLoopBackOff | Container memory limit (64Mi) is significantly lower than application startup allocation (256Mi), causing OOMKilled (Exit Code 137) and subsequent CrashLoopBackOff. |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | container.last_terminated_reason: `OOMKilled` (fact-0785b884910b) | 直接证明进程因内存耗尽被系统杀死 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | container.last_exit_code: `137` (fact-4376421df468) | 确认退出代码 137 与 OOMKilled 一致 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | container.resource_limit.memory: `64Mi` (fact-9f0e33886869) | 提供容器硬限制值，是导致异常的物理约束 |\n| 4 | Logging | Elasticsearch | log.message: `startup allocation 256Mi` (fact-016ce27a1965) | 指出应用启动所需内存为 256Mi，与 64Mi 限制形成直接冲突 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason: `1` (labels: reason=OOMKilled) (fact-9a9b09cf3ed6) | 独立验证了终止原因的客观事实 |\n| 6 | Metric | Prometheus | kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason: `1` (labels: reason=CrashLoopBackOff) (fact-b13d407243ba) | 确认容器当前处于重启退避等待状态 |\n| 7 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | BackOff restarting failed container (x395 over 85m) (fact-041bda937357) | 确认异常持续时间长，符合配置错误导致的循环崩溃 |\n\nKubernetes 层面记录的状态、退出码和事件证实了进程被 OOMKilled 并进入 CrashLoopBackOff；Metric 维度独立观测到相同的 OOMKilled 状态和 CrashLoopBackOff 等待原因；Logging 维度记录了 256Mi 的启动分配需求，解释了为何 64Mi 的内存限制必然导致进程被杀。三者互证，指向内存配置失衡。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n容器内存限制 (64Mi) 低于应用启动需求 (256Mi) → 启动时触发 OOMKilled → 进程退出并立即重启 → 进入 CrashLoopBackOff 循环\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是：容器内存硬限制（`64Mi`，事实 #3）严重低于应用启动时的内存分配需求（`256Mi`，事实 #4）。当容器启动时，应用请求的内存超过了系统硬限制，触发内核 OOM Killer 终止进程，返回退出代码 `137`（事实 #2）。Kubernetes 随后尝试重启容器，但由于配置未变，导致循环崩溃，最终进入 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态（事实 #5, #6, #7）。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v15/workload` | CrashLoopBackOff | Container memory limit (64Mi) is significantly lower than application startup allocation (256Mi), causing OOMKilled (Exit Code 137) and subsequent CrashLoopBackOff. |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | container.last_terminated_reason: `OOMKilled` (fact-0785b884910b) | 直接证明进程因内存耗尽被系统杀死 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | container.last_exit_code: `137` (fact-4376421df468) | 确认退出代码 137 与 OOMKilled 一致 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | container.resource_limit.memory: `64Mi` (fact-9f0e33886869) | 提供容器硬限制值，是导致异常的物理约束 |\n| 4 | Logging | Elasticsearch | log.message: `startup allocation 256Mi` (fact-016ce27a1965) | 指出应用启动所需内存为 256Mi，与 64Mi 限制形成直接冲突 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason: `1` (labels: reason=OOMKilled) (fact-9a9b09cf3ed6) | 独立验证了终止原因的客观事实 |\n| 6 | Metric | Prometheus | kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason: `1` (labels: reason=CrashLoopBackOff) (fact-b13d407243ba) | 确认容器当前处于重启退避等待状态 |\n| 7 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | BackOff restarting failed container (x395 over 85m) (fact-041bda937357) | 确认异常持续时间长，符合配置错误导致的循环崩溃 |\n\nKubernetes 层面记录的状态、退出码和事件证实了进程被 OOMKilled 并进入 CrashLoopBackOff；Metric 维度独立观测到相同的 OOMKilled 状态和 CrashLoopBackOff 等待原因；Logging 维度记录了 256Mi 的启动分配需求，解释了为何 64Mi 的内存限制必然导致进程被杀。三者互证，指向内存配置失衡。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n容器内存限制 (64Mi) 低于应用启动需求 (256Mi) → 启动时触发 OOMKilled → 进程退出并立即重启 → 进入 CrashLoopBackOff 循环\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是：容器内存硬限制（`64Mi`，事实 #3）严重低于应用启动时的内存分配需求（`256Mi`，事实 #4）。当容器启动时，应用请求的内存超过了系统硬限制，触发内核 OOM Killer 终止进程，返回退出代码 `137`（事实 #2）。Kubernetes 随后尝试重启容器，但由于配置未变，导致循环崩溃，最终进入 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态（事实 #5, #6, #7）。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: final
data: {"id": "94a0683416e64280-final", "run_id": "94a0683416e64280", "seq": 1614, "ts_ms": 1789383141059, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v15/workload` | CrashLoopBackOff | Container memory limit (64Mi) is significantly lower than application startup allocation (256Mi), causing OOMKilled (Exit Code 137) and subsequent CrashLoopBackOff. |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | container.last_terminated_reason: `OOMKilled` (fact-0785b884910b) | 直接证明进程因内存耗尽被系统杀死 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | container.last_exit_code: `137` (fact-4376421df468) | 确认退出代码 137 与 OOMKilled 一致 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | container.resource_limit.memory: `64Mi` (fact-9f0e33886869) | 提供容器硬限制值，是导致异常的物理约束 |\n| 4 | Logging | Elasticsearch | log.message: `startup allocation 256Mi` (fact-016ce27a1965) | 指出应用启动所需内存为 256Mi，与 64Mi 限制形成直接冲突 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason: `1` (labels: reason=OOMKilled) (fact-9a9b09cf3ed6) | 独立验证了终止原因的客观事实 |\n| 6 | Metric | Prometheus | kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason: `1` (labels: reason=CrashLoopBackOff) (fact-b13d407243ba) | 确认容器当前处于重启退避等待状态 |\n| 7 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | BackOff restarting failed container (x395 over 85m) (fact-041bda937357) | 确认异常持续时间长，符合配置错误导致的循环崩溃 |\n\nKubernetes 层面记录的状态、退出码和事件证实了进程被 OOMKilled 并进入 CrashLoopBackOff；Metric 维度独立观测到相同的 OOMKilled 状态和 CrashLoopBackOff 等待原因；Logging 维度记录了 256Mi 的启动分配需求，解释了为何 64Mi 的内存限制必然导致进程被杀。三者互证，指向内存配置失衡。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n容器内存限制 (64Mi) 低于应用启动需求 (256Mi) → 启动时触发 OOMKilled → 进程退出并立即重启 → 进入 CrashLoopBackOff 循环\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是：容器内存硬限制（`64Mi`，事实 #3）严重低于应用启动时的内存分配需求（`256Mi`，事实 #4）。当容器启动时，应用请求的内存超过了系统硬限制，触发内核 OOM Killer 终止进程，返回退出代码 `137`（事实 #2）。Kubernetes 随后尝试重启容器，但由于配置未变，导致循环崩溃，最终进入 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态（事实 #5, #6, #7）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.0m\n├─ 问题定位: 11.2s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 39.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v15/workload: 39.1s (Evidence 32.3s, RCA 6.7s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 10.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v15/workload**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 60.503, "metrics": {"run_id": "94a0683416e64280", "mttr": {"value": "1.0m", "seconds": 60.512500286102295, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 60512.500286102295, "llm_calls": 10, "llm_duration_ms": 57382.91025161743, "tool_calls": 9, "executed_tool_calls": 9, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 9, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 7178.393840789795, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2680.164337158203}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 11192.266464233398, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 39142.45891571045, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 10154.263019561768, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

